{{Short description|Football tournament group stage}}
{{Use dmy dates|date=May 2018}}
'''Group 3 of the [[1974 FIFA World Cup]]''' was contested between 15 and 23 June 1974. Matches were played in three cities: [[Dortmund]], [[Hanover]] and [[Düsseldorf]].<ref>{{cite web |url=https://www.rsssf.org/tables/74full.html |title=World Cup 1974 finals |publisher=[[RSSSF]] |access-date=30 April 2026}}</ref>

The pool comprised [[Uruguay national football team|Uruguay]] (''Pot 3-South America''), [[Bulgaria national football team|Bulgaria]] (''Pot 2-Eastern Europe''), [[Netherlands national football team|Netherlands]] (''Pot 1-Western Europe'') and [[Sweden men's national football team|Sweden]] (''Pot 4-Rest of the world'').

